OL,3,GNEWSARhun ap Iorwerth pays tribute in
OL,4,ASenedd to children hurt in bus crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirst Minister Rhun ap Iorwerth is
OL,7,Ftaking questions from opposition party
OL,8,Fleaders and Senedd members as part of
OL,9,Fhis weekly scrutiny session
OL,11,FHe paid tribute to three schoolchildren
OL,12,Fhurt when their bus crashed into a
OL,13,Fbridge in Newport this morning
OL,15,FReform leader Helen Jenner described
OL,16,Fteachers facing "high levels of verbal
OL,17,Fand physical abuse from students" and
OL,18,Fcalled for zero tolerance of violence
OL,19,Fin schools
